yāvān viśvavyavasthāpakaḥ (")śaktayo'sya jagat sarvam ityuktyā śaktīnāṃ 
viśvavyavasthāpakatvam |(") parameśvarasya śaktikalāpaḥ tāvantam 
āmṛśati | tatra mukhyāstāvat tisraḥ parameśvarasya śaktayaḥ anuttaraḥ 
icchā unmeṣa iti tadeva parāmarśatryam a(-)ha(-)u iti etasmādeva tritayāt 
sarvaḥ śaktiprapañcaḥ carcyate anuttara eva hi viśrāntirānandaḥ icchāyāmeva 
