ityāśaṅkyāha tasyeti |(") tasya sṛṣṭisaṃhārabīje mukhyaṃ rūpaṃ 
tadabhyāsāt parasaṃvittilābhaḥ tathāhi(-) kādau mānte sācke anacke vā 
antaruccārite (")uccārite prāṇopāroheṇa smṛte buddhyupāroheṇa |(") 
smṛte vā samaviśiṣṭaḥ saṃvitspandasparśaḥ samayānapekṣitvāt 
paripūrṇaḥ samayāpekṣiṇo'pi (")uttamavṛddhādinā kalpita 
idamasyābhidheyamiti samayaḥ tadvanto ghaṭādayaḥ śabdāḥ tatra 
saṃvidyarthaṃ sākṣātkurvanti yathā manorathādiṣu kāntādiśabdāḥ 
kāmaśokādinā niviḍataraṃ bhāvyamānā asaṃnihitamapi khyādibhāvaṃ 
sākṣāt kurvanti |(") śabdāḥ tadarthabhāvakā manorājyādivat 
anuttarasaṃvitsparśāt ekīkṛtahṛtkaṇṭhoṣṭho dvādaśāntadvayaṃ 
hṛdayaṃ ca ekīkuryāt iti varṇarahasyam | 
antaḥsphuradvimarśānantarasamudbhūtaṃ 

<43>

sitapītādyāntaraṃ varṇam udbhāvyamānaṃ (g: tadbhāvyamānamiti 
pāṭhaḥ |) saṃvidam anubhāvayati iti kecit |

vācyaviraheṇa (")vācyaviraheṇeti vyatiriktavācyābhāvāt |(") saṃvit(-)
spandādindvarkagatinirodhābhyām 
(")bahiḥprasṛtyantarmukhaviśrāntibhyām |(") |
yasya tu samasaṃpraveśāt (kh: nijadhāmasaṃpraveśāt iti pāṭhaḥ |)
pūrṇā (")pūrṇā iti ananyonmukhatvānnirākāṅkṣā |(") 
cidbījapiṇḍavarṇavidhau ||

iti āntaraślokaḥ | iti varṇavidhiḥ | karaṇaṃ tu mudrāprakāśane vakṣyāmaḥ |

vikalpaḥ kasyāpi svayamanupayanpūrṇamayatā(-) (")kasyāpi 
śaktipātavataḥ pūrṇamayatāmityatra karotīti śeṣaḥ upāsat śāktāt |(")
mupāyātsaṃskāraṃ vrajati sa upāyo'tra bahudhā |
dhiyi prāṇe dehe tadanu bahirityāṇavatayā
sa nirṇīto naiṣāṃ paraphalavidhau kāpi hi bhidā (")tathā coktaṃ mālinīvijaye 

uccārakaraṇadhyānavarṇasthānavikalpanaiḥ | 
yo bhavetsa samāveśaḥ samyagāṇava ucyate || 

iti | nanu copāyavaicitryādupeyavaicitryamapi syādeva kāraṇavaicitrye 
kāryavaicitryavaditi na paratattvalābha eva sarveṣāṃ sādhya ityāha naiṣāṃ 
paraphalavidhau iti yadi ca evaṃ kathaṃ tarhi upāyavaicitryam (?) 
śaktipātavaicitryāt iti brūmaḥ yathā śaktipātavaicitryāt 
śāṃbhavaśāktāṇavānāṃ vaicitryaṃ tathā ihāpi ityarthaḥ |(")

<44>

suṇṇa(-)u ravisasi dahana
sa(-)u ussa(-)u ehu saviru |
uhi acchanta(-)u paramapa(-)u
pāva(-)i acire vīru ||

[iti śrīmadabhinavaguptācāryaviracite tantrasāre āṇavaprakāśanaṃ nāma 
pañcamamāhnikam] ||


[atha ṣaṣṭhamāhnikam] |

atha bāhyavidhiḥ |

sa eva sthānaprakalpanaśabdena (uccārakaraṇetyatra |; k: kamyate iti pāṭhaḥ |) 
uktaḥ tatra tridhā sthānaṃ prāṇavāyuḥ (")prāṇa iti 
sāmānyaspandanātmani viśiṣṭe punarvācakarūpastrividha eva yaduktam | 

ṣaḍvidhādadhvanaḥ prācyaṃ yadetattritayaṃ punaḥ | 
eṣa eva sa kālādhvā prāṇe spaṣṭaṃ pratiṣṭhitaḥ || iti |(") śarīraṃ bāhyaṃ 
ca tatra prāṇe tāvat vidhiḥ sarvaḥ (")sarvaḥ ṣaḍvidhaḥ |(") asau 
vakṣyamāṇaḥ adhvā prāṇasthaḥ (")prāṇe sāmānyaspandātmani |(") 
kalyate tasya kramākramakalanaiva (")krameṇākrameṇa ca kalanā bhāvānāṃ 
paricchittiḥ saiva kālaḥ tatra krameṇa kāryakāraṇādau akrameṇa 
citrajñānādau | tathā coktam 

saṃvitsaiva punaḥ svātmagarbhīkṛtakramākramau | 
sphuṭayantī praroheṇa prāṇavṛttiḥ pratiṣṭhitā || iti |(") kālaḥ sa (")nanu 
bhāvāḥ saṃvillagnā evāvabhāsante tat kathaṃ tadanuṣaktasya bhāvavargasya 
kālayogaḥ syādityāha sa ca ityādi yadyevaṃ tarhi parameśvare'pi kālayogo 
bhavedityāśaṅkyāha tadbhāsanam ityādi |(") ca parameśvara eva antarbhāti 

<46>

tadbhāsanaṃ (kh: udbhāsanamiti pāṭhaḥ |) ca devasya kālī 
(")svecchāvabhāsitasya pramātṛprameyādyātmano jagatastadrūpatayā 
kalane sāmarthyaṃ na punaḥ svātmani kaścit akramaḥ kramo veti nahi 
agnerdāhaśaktiyoge sphoṭādyāvirbhāvastadāha kālī nāma śaktiḥ iti |(") 
nāma śaktiḥ bhedena (")bhedena bahiḥprarūḍhatayetyarthaḥ |(") tu 
tadābhāsanaṃ kramākramayoḥ prāṇavṛttiḥ | saṃvideva hi prameyebhyo 
vibhaktaṃ rūpaṃ gṛhṇāti (")svātantryāditi śeṣaḥ |(") ata eva ca 
avacchedayogāt vedyatāṃ yāntī nabhaḥ (")yaduktam | 

saṃvinmātraṃ hi yacchuddhaṃ prakāśaparamārthakam | 
tanmeyamātmanaḥ projjhya viviktaṃ bhāsate nabhaḥ || 

iti na ca prāk prāṇe saṃvit pariṇatā ityuktirviruddhyet śūnyatāvabhāsane'pi na 
kaścidrūpāntaropagraha iti prāgityuktam |(") tataḥ svātantryāt meye 
svīkārautsukyena (")bahirmukhībhāvena |(") nipatantī kriyāśaktipradhānā 
prāṇanārūpā (")yaduktam 

sa eva svātmā meye'smin bhedite svīkriyotsukaḥ | 
patan samuccarattvena prāṇaspandormisaṃjñitaḥ || 

iti viśvottīrṇatvena viśvamayatvasyāvacchedaḥ viśvarahitatvena saṃvit 
śūnyarūpā punastādṛśī satī viśvasvīkāreṇa prāṇarūpatvamāpteti |(") 
jīvasvabhāvā pañcamī rūpaiḥ dehaṃ yataḥ pūrayati (")yaduktam 

sā prāṇavṛttiḥ prāṇādyai rūpaiḥ pañcabhirātmasāt | 
dehaṃ yat kurute saṃvitpūrṇastenaiṣa bhāsate || iti |; kh: prerayati iti 
pāṭhāntaropetaḥ pāṭhaḥ |)

<47>

tato'sau cetana iva bhāti | tatra kriyāśaktau kālādhvā prācyabhāge uttare tu 
mūrtivaicitryarūpo deśādhvā tatra varṇamantrapadādhvanaḥ kālādhvani 
(kh: padādhvānaḥ kālādhvasthitiriti pāṭhaḥ |) sthitiḥ 
parasūkṣmasthūlarūpatvāt | deśādhvasthitistu tattvapurakalātmanā iti bhaviṣyati 
svāvasare | tatra yadyapi dehe sabāhyābhyantaram otaprotarūpaḥ prāṇaḥ tathāpi 
prasphuṭasaṃvedyaprayatnaḥ (")prayatnaḥ prāṇaspandaḥ sa ca dvedhā 
saṃvedyo'saṃvedyaśca tayorapi sphuṭāsphuṭatayā dvaividhyam |(") asau 
hṛdayātprabhṛti (")idamatra tātparyam

hṛccakre tu samākhyātāḥ sādhakānāṃ hitāvahāḥ |
prāṇo vai carate tāsu ahorātravibhāgaśaḥ |
tathā te kathayiṣyāmi pravibhajya yathā sphuṭam |

iti saṃvedyaprayatno'sau ato yadyapi sarvatra dehe vartate nāsaṃvedyayatnaḥ na hi 
svāsaṃvedyayatne kiṃcitphalaṃ svecchayā hi caritaḥ prāṇastattatsiddhinimittam 
iti hṛdayātprabhṛtyeva vibhāgakalpanā |(") iti tata eva ayaṃ nirūpaṇīyaḥ | 
tatra prabhuśaktiḥ (")na ca atraitacchaṅkyaṃ (?) 
sarvavyāpakatvādabhede'pi asya kathaṃ kvacit sphuṭatā kvacidasphuṭatā iti 
tatrāha prabhuśaktiriti | yaduktam 

prabhuśaktiḥ kvacinmukhyā yathāṅgamarudīraṇe | 
ātmaśaktiḥ kvacitkandasaṃkocaspandane yathā ||

prāṇaśaktiḥ kvaciddhārdaṃprāṇacāre yathā sphuṭam | 
dvayaṃ trayaṃ vā mukhyaṃ syādyogināmavadhāninām || 

avadhānādadṛṣṭāṃśādvalavattvādadheraṇāt | 
viparyayo'pi prāṇātmaśaktīnāṃ mukhyatāṃ prati || iti |(")

<48>

ātmaśaktiḥ (")mitapramātṛśaktiḥ |(") yatna iti tritayaṃ prāṇeraṇe 
hetuḥ guṇamukhyabhāvāt | tatra hṛdayāt dvādaśāntāntaṃ svāṅgulaiḥ 
sarvasya (")sarvasya brahmādeḥ kīṭāntasya |(") ṣaṭtriṃśadaṅgulaḥ 
prāṇacāraḥ nirgame praveśe ca svocitabalayatnadehatvāt sarvasya | tatra ghaṭikā 
tithiḥ māso varṣaṃ ca varṣasamūhātmā iti samastaḥ kālaḥ parisamāpyate | tatra 
sapañcāṃśe aṅgule caṣaka iti sthityā ghaṭikodayaḥ ghaṭikā hi ṣaṣṭyā 
caṣakaiḥ tasmāt dvāsaptatyaṅgulā bhavati |

atha tithyudayaḥ | sapādamaṅguladvayaṃ tuṭiḥ ucyate tāsu catasṛṣu praharaḥ 
tuṭyardhaṃ tuṭyardhaṃ tatra saṃdhyā evaṃ nirgame dinaṃ praveśe rātriḥ iti 
tithyudayaḥ (")yaduktam 

saṃvedyarūpaśaśadharabhāgaḥ saṃvedakārkakaranikaraiḥ | 
yāvānyāvati pūrṇaḥ sā hi tithirmagrahaiḥ sphuṭībhavati || iti |(")

<49>

atha māsodayaḥ | tatra dinaṃ kṛṣṇapakṣaḥ (")dine'pānacandrasva kṣayāt 
kṛṣṇapakṣatvam |(") rātriḥ śuklaḥ tatra pūrvaṃ tuṭyardhaṃ antyaṃ ca 
tuṭyardhaṃ viśrāntiḥ akālakalitāḥ 
(")hārdadvādaśāntayostudvyardhayorviśrāntirūpatvātkālakalanā nāstīti |
(") madhyāstu pañcadaśa tuṭaya eva tithayaḥ tatra (")tatra pratituṭau 
tithirūpāyām |(") prakāśo viśrāntiśca iti eta eva dinaniśe (")yaduktam 

saṃvitpratikṣaṇaṃ yasmātprakāśānandayoginī | 
tau kṣiptau yāvati tathā tāvatyeva dinakṣape || iti |(") tatra 
vedyamayatāprakāśo (kh: vedyasamayateti pāṭhaḥ |) dinaṃ vedyasya 
vicārayitari layo rātiḥ te ca prakāśaviśrāntī cirāciravaicitryāt anantabhede 
tatsāmye tu viṣuvat (")yaduktam 

kadācidvastuviśrāntisāmyenātmani carvaṇam | 
vedyavedakasāmyaṃ tatsā rātrindinatulyatā || iti | pramātṛṇāṃ 
vedyagrahaparatvādestāratamyāt saṃvidudayaḥ  kasyacitkṣaṇaḥ kasyacitkalpaḥ 
kasyacinnimeṣaśca syāt iti prakāśe cirāciravaicitryam | tathaiva viśrāntau ca 

vedye viśrāntiradhikā dinadairghyāya kalpate | 
tathaiva svātmaviśrāntivṛttiḥ syādrātrivistaraḥ || iti |(")

<50>

tatra kṛṣṇapakṣe prāṇārke apānacandra āpyāyikām ekāmekāṃ kalām 
arpayati yāvat pañcadaśyāṃ tuṭau dvādaśāntasamīpe 
kṣīṇapṛthagbhūtakalāprasaraḥ candramāḥ prāṇārka eva līyate | tadanantaraṃ 
yat tuṭyardhaṃ sa pakṣasaṃdhiḥ | tasya ca tuṭyardhasya prācyam ardham 
(")prāṇīyamardham |(") āmāvasyaṃ dvitīyaṃ (")apānīyam |(") 
prātipadaṃ | tatra prātipade tasmin bhāge sa āmāvasyo bhāgo yadā 
kāsaprayatnāvadhānādikṛtāt tithicchedāt viśati tadā tatra grahaṇam 
(")tasyāstitheḥ kāsavaśāt dvādaśānte ucchedaḥ tataḥ 

śaktigarbhādadhaḥ sṛṣṭistasmādvṛṣṭiḥ prajāyate | 

iti nītyā niḥśvāsavaśādapānavāhasya cireṇa prasaraṇāttitheradhikībhāvena 
pūrṇatayā paurṇamāsyudayaḥ vṛddhivaśāt pūrṇimābhāgaḥ prātipade 
bhāge yadā viśati tadā candragrahaṇaṃ ketuḥ sūrye vidhau rāhuḥ iti nītyā 
somasahito rāhuḥ | yaduktam 

prāṇārkamānahaṭaghaṭṭitameyacandra(-)
vidrāvitāmṛtarasotsukitaḥ svamātā | 
svarbhānurāvṛṇuta eva raviṃ rasaṃ tu 
puṇye grahe'tra rasayettrayaghaṭṭanajñaḥ || 

iti | tathā 

ādityagrahaṇaṃ caiva loke tadupadiśyate | 
śaktirvai viśati prāṇe yā tuṭistu vidhīyate || 

amāvasyā tu sā jñeyā kṛṣṇapakṣe varānane | 
śaktermadhyordhvabhāge tu tuṭyardhaṃ yatprakīrtitam || 

pakṣasaṃdhistvasau jñeyo'māvasyārdhaṃ pratipadā | 
tithicchedena vai tatra sūryasya grahaṇaṃ bhavet || 

ravibimbāntare devi candrabimbaṃ tadā bhavet | 
tadantare bhavedrāhuramṛtārthī varānane || 

amṛtaṃ sravate candro rāhuśca grasate tu tat | 
pītvā tyajati tadbimbaṃ tadā muktaḥ sa ucyate || iti |(")

<51>

tatra ca vedyarūpasomasahabhūto māyāpramātṛrāhuḥ svabhāvatayā 
vilāpanāśaktaḥ kevalam ācchādanamātrasamarthaḥ sūryagataṃ cāndraṃ 
amṛtaṃ pibati iti | pramātṛpramāṇaprameyatritayāvibhāgakāritvāt sa 
puṇyaḥ kālaḥ pāralaukikaphalapradaḥ | tataḥ praviśati prāṇe cidarka ekaikayā 
kalayā apānacandram āpūrayati (")pratipatsā tu vijñeyā candraścaikakalo 
bhavet | ityādikrameṇa candrapūraṇam |(") yāvat pañcadaśī tuṭiḥ pūrṇimā 
tadanantaraṃ pakṣasaṃdhiḥ 

<52>

grahaṇaṃ ca iti prāgvat etat tu aihikaphalapradam (")aihikasṛṣṭiprādhānyāt |
(") iti māsodayaḥ |

atha varṣodayaḥ | tatra kṛṣṇapakṣa eva uttarāyaṇaṃ ṣaṭsu ṣaṭsu aṅguleṣu 
saṃkrāntiḥ (")prāṇārkasya |(") makarāt mithunāntaṃ | tatra 
pratyaṅgulaṃ pañca tithayaḥ tatrāpi dinarātrivibhāgaḥ evaṃ praveśe 
dakṣiṇāyanaṃ (k: praveśo dakṣiṇāyanamiti pāṭhaḥ |) garbhatvam 
udbhavecchā udbubhūṣutā udbhaviṣyatvam udbhavārambhaḥ udbhavattā 
janmādivikāraṣaṭkaṃ ca iti kramāt makarādiṣu iti (")prāṇārkasya |(") | 
tathaiva upāsā atra (")yaduktam  

ādhānamicchā saṃyoga ānando ghanatā sthitiḥ | 
janma sattā pariṇatirvṛddhirhrāsaḥ kṣayaḥ kramāt || 

māghānmāsātsamārabhya sthitayaḥ parikīrtitāḥ | 
sādhakānāṃ siddhividhau bhāvānāṃ cāpi saṃbhavaḥ || 

iti udbhavanātmakaiṣaṇīyasaṃyuktamicchāmātramudbhavecchā 
svātmanyucchalattvena avasthānamudbhavanam |(") phalaṃ samucitaṃ karoti | 
atra ca dakṣādyāḥ pitāmahāntā rudrāḥ (")atra māseṣu |(") śaktayaśca 
dvādaśādhipataya (")yaduktam 

dakṣaścaṇḍo haraścaṇḍī pramatho bhīmamanmathau | 
śakuniḥ sumatirnanda gopālaka pitāmahāḥ || 

iti saṃkrāntikramāt patayaḥ |(") iti varṣodayaḥ |

<53>

pratyaṅgulaṃ ṣaṣṭiḥ tithaya iti krameṇa saṃkrāntau varṣam ityanena krameṇa 
praveśanirgamayoḥ dvādaśābdodayaḥ pratyaṅgulaṃ tithīnāṃ śatatrayaṃ 
sapañcāṃśe'ṅgule (")pratyaṅgulaṃ tithiśatatraye parikalpite sati 
aṅgulapañcamabhāge tithayaḥ ṣaṣṭirbhavanti anayā paripāṭyā sapañcāṃśe 
aṅgule varṣam |(") varṣaṃ yatra prāk caṣakam uktam iti gaṇanayā 
saṃkrāntau pañca varṣāṇi iti anayā paripāṭyā ekasmin 
prāṇanirgamapraveśakāle ṣaṣṭyabdodayaḥ atra ekaviṃśatisahasrāṇi ṣaṭ 
śatāni iti tithīnāṃ saṃkhyā | tāvatī (")antaryā ṣaṣṭyabdodaye tithisaṃkhyā 
tadvahirdinarātraṃ prāṇacārakalpanam |(") eva ahorātre prāṇasaṃkhyā iti na 
ṣaṣṭyabdodayāt adhikaṃ parīkṣyate ānantyāt | tatra 
(")bāhyasamayakalpanāyāṃ |(") mānuṣaṃ varṣaṃ devānāṃ tithiḥ anena 
(")pakṣamāsāyanavarṣādikalanākrameṇa |(") krameṇa divyāni 
dvādaśavarṣasahasrāṇi caturyugam | catvāri trīṇi dve ekam iti kṛtāt prabhṛti 
tāvadbhiḥ 

<54>

śataiḥ aṣṭau saṃdhyāḥ | caturyugānām ekasaptatyā manvantaram manvantaraiḥ 
caturdaśabhiḥ brāhmaṃ dinaṃ brahmadinānte kālāgnidagdhe lokatraye 
(")bhūrbhuvaḥ svarlakṣaṇe |(") lokatraye anyatra ca lokatraye 
(")jalatattvavāsināṃ yadāyustadagnitattvasthānāṃ dinam iti krama 
ekaikavarṣaśatavṛddhyā |(") dhūmaprasvāpite sarve janā 
vegavadagnipreritā janaloke pralayākalībhūya tiṣṭhanti | prabuddhāstu 
kūṣmāṇḍahāṭakeśādyā maholoke krīḍanti | tato niśāsamāptau brāhmī 
sṛṣṭiḥ | anena mānena varṣaśataṃ brahmāyuḥ | tat viṣṇoḥ dinaṃ tāvatī ca 
rātriḥ tasyāpi śatam āyuḥ | tat dinaṃ tadūrdhve rudralokaprabho rudrasya tāvatī 
rātriḥ prāgvat varṣaṃ tacchatamapi ca avadhiḥ | tatra rudrasya tadavasitau 
śivatvagatiḥ rudrasya uktādhikārāvadhiḥ brahmāṇḍadhārakāṇāṃ tat dinaṃ 
śatarudrāṇāṃ niśā tāvatī teṣāmapi ca śatamāyuḥ | śatarudrakṣaye 
brahmāṇḍavināśaḥ | evaṃ jalatattvāt avyaktāntam etadeva krameṇa rudrāṇām 
āyuḥ | pūrvasyāyuruttarasya (")jalatattvavāsināṃ 
yadāyustadagnitattvasthānāṃ dinam iti krama ekaikavarṣaśatavṛddhyā |(")

<55>

dinam iti | tataśca brahmā (")buddhitattvasthaḥ |(") rudrāśca 
abādyadhikāriṇaḥ avyakte tiṣṭhanti iti | śrīkaṇṭhanāthaśca 
(")puṃtattvasthaḥ |(") tadā saṃhartā | eṣo'vāntarapralayaḥ 
(")avāntarapralayasya uktatvāt |(") tatkṣaye sṛṣṭiḥ | tatra 
śāstrāntaramuktā (")sāṃkhyavedāntādiśāstrabhāṣitamuktāḥ |(") api 
sṛjyante | yattu śrīkaṇṭhanāthasya svam āyuḥ tat kañcukavāsināṃ 
rudrāṇāṃ dinaṃ tāvatī rajanī teṣāṃ yadāyuḥ tat gahaneśadinaṃ 
(")gahaneśasya māyāgarbhādhikāriṇaḥ |(") tāvatī eva kṣapā tasyāṃ ca 
samastameva māyāyāṃ vilīyate | punaḥ gahaneśaḥ sṛjati | evaṃ yaḥ 
avyaktakālaḥ taṃ daśabhiḥ parārdhaiḥ guṇayitvā māyādinaṃ kathayet tāvatī 
