anyonyaśleṣāt alakṣaṇīyāntaratvaṃ puṃskalayoḥ | māyāgarbhādhikāriṇastu 
(")ananteśasya |(") kasyacidīśvarasya prasādāt sarvakarmakṣaye 
māyāpuruṣaviveko bhavati yena māyordhve vijñānākala āste na jātucit 
māyādhaḥ kalāpuṃviveko vā yena 

<81>

kalordhve (")yena māyādho na saṃsaret |(") tiṣṭhati | prakṛtipuruṣaviveko 
vā yena pradhānādho na saṃsaret | malapuruṣaviveke (")yadyevaṃ 
tanmāyordhvaṃ kadā gacchati ityāha malapuruṣeti |(") tu śivasamānatvaṃ | 
puruṣapūrṇatādṛṣṭau (")malasaṃskārapraśame 
svātantryākhyavimarśadārḍhye sati |(") tu śivatvameveti | evaṃ 
kalātattvameva kiṃcitkartṛtvadāyi (kh: kartṛtvābhidhāyi iti pāṭhaḥ |)
na ca kartṛtvam ajñasya iti | kiṃcijjñatvadāyinyaśuddhavidyā kalāto 
jātā sā (")nanu sāṃkhyairanabhihitasya kartṛtvasya upapādakaṃ 
kalātattvaṃ ceducyate yuktametat taiḥ punarbuddhyādidvāreṇa uktasya 
jñatvasyābhidhāyi vidyātattvaṃ kimartham ityāha seti |(") ca vidyā buddhiṃ 
paśyati tadgatāṃśca sukhādīn vivekena gṛhṇāti | 
buddherguṇasaṃkīrṇākārāyā (")yadyapi sāṃkhyāḥ varaṇātmanā tamasā 
samāvṛtamapi rajasā śanaiḥ tadapasāraṇāt kvacideva pravartitaṃ sat 
aviśeṣeṇa prakāśātmakamapi sattvaṃ krameṇa sukhādi prakāśayediti 
triguṇāpi buddhiḥ krameṇa sukhādyātmano viṣayasya vivekena pradarśikā iti 
kathayanti tathāpi buddhiḥ sukhādyātmakaṃ viṣayaṃ darpaṇavadeva darśayet 
na vivekena guṇasaṃkīrṇatvāt ityata āha buddherguṇasaṃkīrṇākārāyā ityādi |
(") vivekena grahītumasāmarthyāt | tasmāt buddhipratibimbito bhāvo vidyayā 
vivicyate | kiṃcitkartṛtvaṃ 

<82>

kiṃcidbhāgasiddhaye kvacideva (")nanu kiñcijjñatvenaiva 
kiñcitkartṛtvamapi ākṣiptamiti kimarthaṃ kiñcitkartṛtvamityatra punaḥ 
kiñcicchabdanirdeśa ityata āha kvacideveti |(") kartṛtvam ityatra arthe 
paryavasyati kvacideva ca ityatra bhāge rāgatattvasya vyāpāraḥ | na (")nanu 
avairāgyalakṣaṇo buddhidharmo'tra sāṅkhyairnimittamuktamiti 
kimanenāpūrveṇa rāgatattvenetyāha na cetyādi |(") ca avairāgyakṛtaṃ tat 
avairāgyasyāpi araktidarśanāt | vairāgye dharmādāvapi raktirdṛśyate | 
tṛptasya ca annādau avairāgyābhāve'pi antaḥstharāgānapāyāt | tena vinā 
punaravairāgyānutpattiprasaṅgāt (")tena rāgatattvasyaivāyaṃ mahimā yat 
buddhāvavairāgyādīnāṃ sarveṣāmeva dharmāṇāṃ bahiṣparyantatayā 
viśeṣeṇollāsa iti |(") | kālaśca kāryaṃ kalayaṃstadavacchinnaṃ 
(")akaravaṃ karomi kariṣyāmi iti pratītyanyathānupapattyā |(") 
kartṛtvamapi kalayati tulye kvacittve asminneva kartṛtvam ityatrārthe 
niyatervyāpāraḥ | kāryakāraṇabhāve'pi asyā eva vyāpāraḥ tena kalāta eva 
etaccatuṣkaṃ jātam idameva (")idamevetyādina māyā kalā kāla vidyā rāga 
niyatīnāṃ krameṇa nirdeśaḥ |(") kiṃcidadhunā jānan abhiṣvaktaḥ karomi 
ityevaṃrūpā

<83>

saṃvid dehapuryaṣṭakādigatā paśurityucyate | tadidaṃ māyādiṣaṭkaṃ 
(")māyādikaṃ hi taṇḍulakalpe ātmani tudhavatsaṃlagnaṃ sthitam |(") 
kañcukaṣaṭkam ucyate | saṃvido māyayā apahastitatvena kalādīnām 
uparipātināṃ kañcukavat avasthānāt | evaṃ kiṃcitkartṛtvaṃ yat 
māyākāryaṃ tatra kiṃcittvaviśiṣṭaṃ yat kartṛtvaṃ viśeṣyaṃ tatra 
vyāpriyamāṇā kalā vidyādiprasavahetuḥ iti nirūpitam | idānīṃ viśeṣaṇabhāgo 
yaḥ kiṃcidityukto (")kalāyāstāvat kiñcidrūpatāviśiṣṭaṃ kartṛtvaṃ 
lakṣaṇaṃ tatra viśeṣyabhāge viśeṣyāṃśarūpaṃ yatkartṛtvaṃ tat 
bhoktṛrūpaṃ tathā kartṛtvasya svayamanavacchinnatve'pi yat 
kiñcidviṣayatvāt kiñcidrūpatvaṃ viśeṣaṇāṃśarūpaṃ tadvedyapakṣa eva 
sthitam tataśca tadaṃśaprayojakīkāreṇa ullasitaṃ sat 
bhāvivedyaviśeṣāpekṣayā vedyasāmānyātmakaṃ bhogyarūpaṃ pradhānam iti 
|(") jñeyaḥ kāryaśca taṃ yāvat sā kalā svātmanaḥ pṛthak kurute 
(")vahī rūpatayā vyaktatāṃ nayati |(") tāvat eṣa eva 
sukhaduḥkhamohātmakabhogyaviśeṣānusyūtasya sāmānyamātrasya 
(")viśeṣasya sāmānyapūrvakatvāt sāmyātmakasyāvibhāgarūpasya 
pradhānatattvasyetyarthaḥ |(") tadguṇasāmyāparanāmnaḥ prakṛtitattvasya 
sargaḥ iti bhoktṛbhogyayugalasya samameva (")yaduktam 

samameva hi bhogyaṃ ca bhoktāraṃ ca prasūyate |
kalā bhedābhisandhānādaviyuktaṃ parasparam ||

iti | vastuto hi anayoḥ 

bhoktaiva bhogyabhāvena sadā sarvatra saṃsthitaḥ |

ityādyukteradvayapāramārthikatayā abhede'pi māyīyaṃ bhedamabhisaṃdhāya 
parasparasāpekṣālakṣaṇamaviyuktatvaṃ darśitamiti |(") kalātattvāyattā 
sṛṣṭiḥ |

<84>

atra caiṣāṃ vāstavena pathā kramavandhyaiva (")parasparasāpekṣatvāt 
kramasyeti bhāvaḥ |(") sṛṣṭirityuktaṃ kramāvabhāso'pi cāstītyapi 
(")ekaḥ kramaḥ sa ca vicitra iti apiśabdārthaḥ śatru(-)ṛddhimakṣyāyena 
| ekaḥ śatruḥ sa eva ṛddhimāniti śatru(-)ṛddhimakṣyāyaḥ |(") 
uktameva | kramaśca vidyārāgādīnāṃ vicitro'pi dṛṣṭaḥ kaścidrajyan vetti 
ko'pi vidan rajyate ityādi | tena bhinnakramanirūpaṇamapi rauravādiṣu śāstreṣu 
aviruddhaṃ mantavyaṃ tadeva tu bhogyasāmānyaṃ prakṣobhagataṃ guṇatattvam 
| yatra (")nanu sattvarajastamasāṃ sāmyāvasthā prakṛtiriti sāṃkhyoktanītiḥ 
tatkathamuktaṃ prakṛtigataṃ sukhādi bhogyamityāśaṅkyāha yatreti |(") 
sukhaṃ bhogyarūpaprakāśaḥ sattvam duḥkhaṃ 
prakāśāprakāśāndolanātmakam ata eva kriyārūpaṃ rajaḥ mohaḥ 
prakāśābhāvarūpastamaḥ | tritayamapi 

<85>

etat bhogyarūpam | evaṃ (")nanu sāṃkhyoktanītyā kṣubdhameva pradhānaṃ 
kāryavargasya kāraṇamastu tat kimarthamuktaṃ kalpanādāyi 
guṇatattvamityāśaṅkyāha evamiti | yaduktam

na vaiṣamyamanāpannaṃ kāraṇaṃ kāryasūtaye | iti |(") kṣubdhāt pradhānāt 
kartavyāntarodayaḥ (k: kartṛvyāpārāntarodaya iti pāṭhaḥ |) na 
akṣubdhāditi | kṣobhaḥ avaśyameva antarāle abhyupagantavya iti siddhaṃ 
sāṃkhyāparidṛṣṭaṃ pṛthagbhūtaṃ guṇatattvaṃ (")yaduktam

naitatkāraṇatārūpaparāmarśāvarodhi yat |
kṣobhāntaraṃ tataḥ kāryaṃ bījocchūnāṅkurādivat ||

iti | tena guṇānāmapi tattvarūpatvamabhyupagantavyamiti bhāvaḥ |(") | sa 
(")nanu asyā jaḍatvāt kathaṃ kāryajananāya aunmukhyaṃ jāyate tataśca 
kṣubdhatvamapi na syāt ityāha sa ca kṣobha ityādinā | ayamatra bhāvaḥ 
sāṃkhyamate hi puṃso nirvikāratvāt bandhamokṣadaśayoraviśeṣa eveti 
baddhavanmuktamapi prati prakṛtiḥ kimiva na mahadādi vikārajātaṃ janayituṃ 
pravartate pravṛttyātmanaḥ svabhāvasyānapetatvāt | na cāsyā 
dṛṣṭāhamanena iti na punaretadarthaṃ pravarte ityanusaṃdhānamasti 
ācaitanyāt tasmāt anirmokṣa eveti | asmanmate hi svatantreśakartṛkaḥ kṣobhaḥ 
ato na kaścit doṣa iti |(") ca kṣobhaḥ prakṛtestattveśādhiṣṭhānādeva 
anyathā niyataṃ puruṣaṃ prati iti na siddhyet | tato guṇatattvāt buddhitattvaṃ 
yatra puṃprakāśo viṣayaśca pratibimbam (")dvividho hi viṣayapratibimbaḥ 
akṣadvāreṇa pratyakṣādau ataddvāreṇa utprekṣādau | 
puṃprakāśapratibimbādhāratvācca jāḍye'pi viṣayaprakāśo buddheriti |(")

<86>

arpayataḥ | buddhitattvāt ahaṅkāro (")ahaṃkārasya cāsādharaṇaṃ 
kāryamihāpayogitvāllikhyate ahaṃkāra eva saṃrambhātmikayā vṛttyā 
prāṇādīnāṃ preraṇaṃ karoti yena karmabhogānuvedhanaṃ tāvat jīvati sa eva ca 
tadavasāne teṣāmapreraṇaṃ karoti yena mriyate | yathoktamanyatra 

ahaṃkṛtā pañcavidho vāyuḥ saṃrambharūpayā |
prerito jīvanāya syādanyathā maraṇaṃ punaḥ || iti |(") yena buddhipratibimbite 
vedyasaṃparke kaluṣe puṃprakāśe anātmani ātmābhimānaḥ śuktau 
rajatābhimānavat | ata eva kāra ityanena kṛtakatvam asya uktaṃ sāṃkhyasya tu 
tat na yujyate sa hi na ātmano'haṃvimarśamayatām icchati vayaṃ tu 
kartṛtvamapi tasya icchāmaḥ | tacca śuddhaṃ vimarśa eva apratiyogi 
(")evaṃ cāsyā ahaṃkṛtaḥ śuddhacitsvātantryamayāt 
svātmamātraviśrāntisatattvāt svarasoditādahambhāvāt iyānviśeṣaḥ yadiyaṃ 
jaḍāyāmanātmarūpāyāṃ buddhāvabhiniviṣṭeti |(") 
svātmacamatkārarūpo'hamiti | eṣo'sya ahaṃkārasya karaṇaskandhaḥ 
(")indriyarūpatetyarthaḥ |(") | prakṛtiskandhastu 
(")kāraṇarūpatetyarthaḥ |(") tasyaiva trividhaḥ sattvādibhedāt |

<87>

tatra sāttviko (")sāttvikaḥ sattvapradhāno yato guṇībhūtatayā rajastamasorapi 
sadbhāva ityarthaḥ |(") yasmāt manaśca buddhindriyapañcakaṃ ca tatra 
manasi janye sarvatanmātrajananasāmarthyayuktaḥ sa janakaḥ | śrotre tu 
śabdajananasāmarthyaviśiṣṭa (")anyonyamithunāḥ sarve sarve sarvatra 
gāminaḥ |

ityuktyā anyonyamithunavṛttitvātsattvapradhāne'pyahaṅkāre 
tamaḥpradhānādahaṅkārāttanmātrāṇāmutpādaḥ 
sarvaviśiṣṭādahaṅkārānmanasaḥ tenedamāpatati yadahaṅkṛtaḥ 
sarvatanmātrakaraṇatvaṃ tena manasaḥ śabdādīnāṃ grāhyagrāhakabhāvo 
bhavet tatrāntaḥkaraṇatrayasya viśeṣaguṇā icchāsaṃrambhabodhākhyā 
ityanyatra nirūpitāḥ |(") iti yāvat ghrāṇe gandhajananayogyatāyukta iti 
bhautikamapi (")grāhyagrāhakabhāvaniyamānyathānupapattyā 
bhautikatvamindriyāṇāmiti tarkamataṃ tathā ca pārthivatvāt ghrāṇaṃ 
gandhasyaiva grāhakaṃ na rasāderiti tasyāyuktatāṃ darśayati 
bhautikatvamityādinā |(") na yuktam ahaṃ śṛṇomi ityādyanugamācca 
sphuṭam āhaṅkārikatvam karaṇatvena (")śrotrādīnāmāhaṃkārikatayā 
karaṇatvaṃ ghaṭate nānyathā kutaḥ (?) ityāha karaṇetyādi | anyatheti 
kartraśādeva preraṇe kriyāviṣayatvāditi cet na anavasthā patet āhaṃkārikatve 
sati kartraśasparśatvaṃ yuktamahaṃparāmarśānuvedhādahaṃkṛtaḥ |( k: 
kāraṇatve ceti pāthaḥ |) ca avaśyaṃ kartraṃśasparśitvam anyathā 
karaṇāntarayojanāyām

<88>

anavasthādyāpātāt | kartraṃśaśca ahaṅkāra eva tena mukhye karaṇe 
(")yaduktam |

vidyāṃ vinā hi nānyeṣāṃ karaṇānāṃ nijā sthitiḥ |
kalāṃ vinā na tasyāśca kartṛtve jñātṛtā yataḥ ||

kalāvidye tataḥ puṃsāṃ mukhyaṃ tatkaraṇaṃ viduḥ | iti |(") dve puṃsaḥ 
jñāne vidyā kriyāyāṃ kalā andhasya paṅgośca 
ahantārūpajñānakriyānapagamāt (")apagame tu bāhyamarthaṃ prati 
pravṛttirna syāt | taduktam

ata eva vihīne'smin buddhikarmendriyaiḥ kvacit |
andhe paṅgau rūpagatiprakāśo na na bhāsate || iti |( k: paṅgoḥ śāntā 
jñānarūpakriyā iti pāṭhaḥ |) udriktatanmātrabhāgaviśiṣṭāt tu 
sāttvikādeva ahaṃkārāt karmendriya pañcakam ahaṃ gacchāmi iti 
ahaṅkāraviśiṣṭaḥ kāryakaraṇakṣamaḥ pādendriyaṃ tasya 
mukhyādhiṣṭhānaṃ bāhyam anyatrāpi tadastyeva iti rugṇasyāpi na 
gativicchedaḥ (")hastādau gamanakriyādarśanāditi bhāvaḥ |(") | na ca 
kartavyasāṃkaryamuktādeva hetoḥ kriyā karaṇakāryā mukhyaṃ ca 
gamanādīnāṃ kriyātvaṃ na rūpādyupalambhasya tasya kāṇādatantre guṇatvāt 
tasmāt avaśyābhyupeyaḥ karmendriyavargaḥ | sa ca pañcakaḥ 
anusandhestāvattvāt |

<89>

tathāhi bahistāvattyāgāya vā anusandhiḥ ādānāya vā dvayāya vā 
ubhayarahitatvena svarūpaviśrāntaye (")yatra hi idaṃ heyamidamupādeyamiti 
kṣobhaḥ praśāmyati |(") vā tatra krameṇa pāyuḥ pāṇi pāda upastha iti | 
antaḥ prāṇāśrayakarmānusandhestu vāgindriyam tena indriyādhiṣṭhāne 
(")nanu ca pāṇinā viharaṇaṃ pādenādānamityanyonyavṛttisāṃkaryaṃ 
kutastyamityata āha tena ityādi | nahi pāṇirviharaṇaṃ pādo vā ādānaṃ karoti 
api tu ekasminnevādhiṣṭhāne pādaḥ pāṇiśca viharaṇamādānaṃ ca kurute 
sarvaśarīravyāpakatvādeva sahavṛttyopalambha iti na kaścit doṣaḥ | taduktam |

etatkartavyacakraṃ tadasāṃkaryeṇa kurvate |
akṣāṇi sahavṛttyā tu buddhyante saṃkaraṃ jaḍāḥ || iti |(") haste yat 
gamanaṃ tadapi pādendriyasyaiva karma iti mantavyam tena karmānantyamapi na 
indriyānantyam āvahet iyati rājasasya upaśleṣakatvam ityāhuḥ | anye tu 
rājasānmana ityāhuḥ | anye tu sāttvikāt mano rājasācca indriyāṇi iti | 
bhoktraṃśācchādakāt (")bhogyāṃśasyodbhūtatayā prādhānyāt |(") tu 
tamaḥpradhānāhaṃkārāt tanmātrāṇi vedyaikarūpāṇi pañca | 
śabdaviśeṣāṇāṃ hi kṣobhātmanāṃ yadekam 

<90>

akṣobhātmakaṃ prāgbhāvi (")yathoktam |

viśeṣāṇāṃ yato'vaśyaṃ daśā prāgaviśeṣiṇī |

iti | tena naitanmantavyaṃ kimebhiraparokṣairaviśeṣairviśeṣā eva pratyakṣā 
abhyupagamyantāmiti |(") sāmānyam aviśeṣātmakaṃ tat śabdatanmātraṃ | 
evaṃ gandhānte'pi vācyaṃ | tatra śabdatanmātrāt kṣubhitāt (")kṣubhitāt 
kāryajananonmukhādityarthaḥ |(") avakāśadānavyāpāraṃ 
(")avakāśadānavyāpāratvānnabhaso'nuguṇaṃ kāraṇaṃ śabda ityarthaḥ |
(") nabhaḥ śabdasya vācyādhyāsāvakāśasahatvāt (")tena yathā śabdaḥ 
svātmani vācyasyādhyāsasahatvādavakāśaṃ dadāti tathā tatkāryamākāśo'pi 
sarvasyeti |(") | śabdatanmātraṃ kṣubhitaṃ vāyuḥ śabdastu asya nabhasā 
virahābhāvāt | rūpaṃ kṣubhitaṃ tejaḥ pūrvaguṇau tu pūrvavat | rasaḥ kṣubhita 
āpaḥ pūrve trayaḥ pūrvavat | gandhaḥ kṣubhito dharā pūrve catvāraḥ pūrvavat | 
anye śabdasparśābhyāṃ vāyuḥ ityādikrameṇa pañcabhyo dharaṇī iti 
manyante | guṇasamudāyamātraṃ ca pṛthivī nānyo guṇī kaścit (")yaduktam 
|

nāgṛhītaistu gandhādyairjātucijjāyate matiḥ |
dharitryā hi jalādīnāmagrahe'pi prajāyate |
gandhādibhyastato nānyā jalādibhyaḥ pṛthak ca bhūḥ || iti |(") | asmiṃśca 
tattvakalāpe 

<91>

ūrdhvordhvaguṇaṃ vyāpakaṃ nikṛṣṭaguṇaṃ tu vyāpyaṃ | sa eva guṇasya 
utkarṣo yat tena vinā guṇāntaraṃ na upapadyate tena pṛthivītattvaṃ 
(")yathoktaṃ śrītantrāloke |

ataḥ śivatvātprabhṛti prakāśatā(-)
svarūpamādāya nijātmani dhruvam |
samastatattvāvalidharmasaṃcayai(-)
rvibhāti bhūrvyāptṛtayā sthitairalam ||

evaṃ jalāderapi śaktitattva(-)
paryantadhāmno vapurasti tādṛk |
kiṃ tūttaraṃ śaktitayaiva tattva
pūrvaṃ tu taddharmatayeti bhedaḥ ||

iti etacca parāttriṃśikāvivaraṇe samyaṅnirṇītam |(") śivatattvāt prabhṛti 
jalatattvena vyāptam evaṃ jalaṃ tejasā ityādi yāvacchaktitattvam ||

bhūtāni tanmātragaṇendriyāṇi
mūlaṃ pumānkañcukayuksuśuddham |
vidyādiśaktyantamiyānsvasaṃvit(-)
sindhostaraṅgaprasaraprakāraḥ ||

a(-)alatattapari(-)uṇṇa(-)u
sa(-)alatatta(-)uttiṇṇa(-)u |
pari(-)āṇaha(-)attāṇṇa(-)u
paramasiveṇa samāṇa(-)u ||

[iti śrīmadabhinavaguptācāryaviracite tantrasāre tattvasvarūpaprakāśanaṃ 
nāmāṣṭamamāhnikam] ||8||


[atha navamamāhnikam] |

atha tattvānāṃ bhedo nirūpyate |

sa ca saptadhā ṣaḍardhaśāstra eva paraṃ parameśena (")nanu trikamate 
naraśaktiśivātmakaṃ viśvamuktaṃ tat kathaṃ siddhāntadarśanocitaḥ 
pramātṛbheda ukta ityāśaṅkyāha parameśenetyādi | yaduktam

śaktimacchaktibhedena dharādyaṃ mūlapaścimam |
bhidyate pañcadaśadhā svarūpeṇa sahānarāt ||

kalāntaṃ bhedayugdhīnaṃ rudravatpralayākalaḥ |
tadvanmāyāpi navadhā jñakalā saptadhā punaḥ ||

mantrāstadīśāḥ pañcānye mantreśapatayastridhā |
śivo na bhidyate svaikaprakāśaghanacinmayaḥ || iti |(") uktaḥ | tatra śivāḥ 
