dehapāte śivaṃ vrajet |

dṛṣṭvā śiṣyaṃ jarāgrastaṃ vyādhibhiḥ paripīḍitam |
utkramayya tatastvenaṃ pare tattve niyojayet ||

iti nītyā sadyo nirvāṇadīkṣādvāreṇa pare tattve yojitaḥ syādityarthaḥ | ata eva 
