tattve bhogecchā asya bhavati tatraiva samastavyastatayā (")samasteti 
aṇḍakalpanayā avāntarabhedakalpanayā ca |( g: samastamiti padaṃ nāsti |) 
yojayet | tadanantaraṃ śeṣavṛttaye parameśvarasvabhāvāt jhaṭiti prasṛtaṃ 
